# `collections.watch`

Live watch — all collections, one collection (filterable), or one item.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.collection.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `collections` | `map` |
| `collection` | `string` |
| `item` | `map` |
| `query_json` | `string` |

## Returns

`WatchEvent` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `patches` | `map` |
| `err` | `map` |
| `hb` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call collections.watch --json '{ "collections": {}, "collection": "", "item": {}, "query_json": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "patches": {
    "patches": [
      {
        "op": "PATCH_OP_SET",
        "value": "eyJpdGVtcyI6W119"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
